summary_and_contributions.value:
1) The first to provide a computational framing of mutual exclusivity via Low-shot Object Learning with Mutual Exclusivity Bias(LSME); 
2) A dataset generation pipeline that enables the creation of progressively more challenging LMSE tasks using any set of 3D models;
 3) Performance benchmarking of multiple baselines including foundation models on this novel task; 
4) A novel baseline method that defines the SOTA on LMSE

